      "writtenOn": "2019-01-07T22:59:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe get rid of the TODO but keep the reference to the bug?\n\n...hopefully our i2c driver actually supports super long clock stretching.  Do you happen to know if it does?",
