        "id": 1148900
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-08T02:39:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, I think EC i2c driver only waits for up to ((5us + overhead) * 10) when SCL is hold low by the slave:\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/c06af8d8c2326a3ebc096dfaa4a2640c1ded1333/common/i2c_master.c#507",
      "parentUuid": "e0304e2d_f43af31b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 427,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 431,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "c79abec6365e3394e8eb323ab8546b0f39c9318e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
